# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rush-Decomp .gitignore
#
# The line this file draws is between the CARTRIDGE and WORK DERIVED FROM IT.
#
#   Never committed, under any circumstance:
#     baserom/   the user's own dump -- the copyrighted image itself
#     build/     build products, including rebuilt.nds, which IS a ROM image
#     data/      raw component blobs, byte-identical chunks of the cartridge
#     fsdump/    raw NitroFS files, likewise verbatim
#     tools/keys/  the Nintendo KEY1 blob is copyrighted firmware data
#
#   Committed, because it is the work product of this project:
#     asm/       disassembly, with the symbol names and structure a human gave it
#     assets/    art and audio CONVERTED out of the cartridge's own formats,
#                plus symbol maps and filesystem listings
#     src/       hand-written reconstruction
#
# data/ and fsdump/ stay out not because they are derived -- asm/ is derived too
# -- but because they are verbatim: concatenated they reconstitute most of the
# cartridge, which is the thing the project exists to avoid publishing. They are
# also one `make extract` away for anyone holding a dump. asm/ and assets/ are
# transformations, and are what pret/pokered publishes for Pokemon Red/Blue.
#
# See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md ("What belongs in this repository").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- The cartridge image and its verbatim contents --------------------------
baserom/**
!baserom/.gitkeep
*.nds
*.srl
*.ds
*.nd
*.srl.nds
*.dsg
*.bin.gz
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# Keep the synthetic self-test ROM out of the binary-extension rule; it is
# original code generated by tests/make_test_rom.py, never a retail dump.
!tests/data/testrom.nds

# Raw extraction output: ARM9/ARM7/overlay blobs split out of the image, plus
# the banner and secure area. Regenerated by `make extract`.
data/**
!data/.gitkeep

# Raw Nitro file system dump (models, textures, scripts, sound archives...).
# Verbatim files, not conversions. Regenerated by `make dumpfs`.
fsdump/**
!fsdump/.gitkeep

# Build products. rebuilt.nds is a complete cartridge image and must never be
# committed, which the *.nds rule above already guarantees.
build/**
!build/.gitkeep
*.o
*.a
*.elf
*.map
*.d
*.lst

# --- Nintendo KEY1 / secrets ------------------------------------------------
tools/keys/**
!tools/keys/.gitkeep
*.key
*.pem

# --- Toolchain state --------------------------------------------------------
tools/.cache/**
tools/bin/**
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Editors / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
